WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.470
People don't experience life in banking products.

2
00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:07.030
They get married, have children, start planning for their first home.

3
00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:14.350
But when they come to a bank, those moments often become separate journeys: a mortgage, an account, protection.

4
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.850
The customer has one life.

5
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:19.690
We ask them to navigate multiple processes.

6
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.970
What if we started with what they're actually trying to do?

7
00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.050
Meet Baz.

8
00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.310
Baz is a conversational banking proof of concept.

9
00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:33.870
It begins with the customer's circumstances, asks relevant questions, and connects their needs to banking services.

10
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:41.770
Crucially, it explores how that conversation can use capabilities the bank already owns rather than rebuilding everything underneath.

11
00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:45.130
One conversation, a more connected experience.

12
00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:46.870
Here's what that looks like.
